  "title": "Quick Braised Egyptian Tripe Tagine",
  "description": "A snappy, vegan-friendly Egyptian dish featuring tripe, bonito, and aromatic spices, all cooked to perfection in a traditional kadhai. Perfect for a lazy Sunday meal.",
