      "amount": "1 bunch",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large kadhai over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the tripe, cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir well to combine, then add the water.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the bonito flakes and cook for a further 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
  ],
